# Copy to .env.local (gitignored). The gates resolve the key from THIS file
# first, then .env, then LEGION_REPO/.env.local, then the environment (last —
# a stale OS-level export is a known trap). Use a dedicated key with a
# server-side spending cap: one runaway run once took an account negative,
# and an empty balance stops every model.
KIE_API_KEY=

# Optional: a sibling repo whose .env.local holds the shared key
# LEGION_REPO=/path/to/another/repo

# Rosters — defaults are what one domain's auditions found. Re-audition on
# yours (examples/auditions/*) and overwrite. Seat by ROLE, not by family.
# LEGION_BRAIN_ROSTER=kie:gpt-6-luna,kie:gpt-6.1-sol
# LEGION_BRAIN_SECOND_ROSTER=kie:claude-sonnet-5-5,kie:claude-haiku-5-5
# LEGION_MUSCLE_ROSTER=kie:gpt-6.1-sol,kie:claude-sonnet-5-5,kie:claude-haiku-5-5
# LEGION_SECOND_ROSTER=kie:claude-sonnet-5-5,kie:claude-haiku-5-5
# LEGION_IMPL_ROSTER=kie:gpt-6.1-sol,kie:gpt-6-luna
# LEGION_BRAIN_EFFORT=low        # medium for hard planning; never omit — see docs
